@gateway = http://localhost:5000

### Obter token
# @name token
POST {{gateway}}/auth/v1/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "demo",
  "password": "vinheria-demo"
}

### Consultar estoque
GET {{gateway}}/estoque/v1/estoque
Authorization: Bearer {{token.response.body.$['access_token']}}

### Criar pedido e publicar evento
POST {{gateway}}/pedidos/v1/pedidos
Authorization: Bearer {{token.response.body.$['access_token']}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "vinho-tinto",
  "quantity": 1
}

### Documentação do Gateway para Auth
GET {{gateway}}/docs/auth
